10. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 1 of 2011 concerning National Socio-Cultural Strategy to Realize Gender Equality (State News of the Republic of Indonesia of 2011 Number 20);
11. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 11 of 2011 concerning Policy for the Development of Child-Friendly Regencies/Cities;
12. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 12 of 2011 concerning Indicators of Child-Friendly Regencies/Cities;
13. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 13 of 2011 concerning Guidelines for the Development of Child-Friendly Regencies/Cities;
